{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>Ships from the coast of Kittim.</b> And the Kittim — who are the Romans — will pass in great ships against Asshur." "<b>And they shall afflict Ever.</b> And they shall afflict those who are across the river." "<b>And he also shall perish forever.</b> And Daniel likewise explained: ״עַד דִּיקְטִילַת חֵיוְתָא וְהוֹבַד גִּשְׁמַהּ״ (Daniel 7)." "<b>And ships.</b> Great ships, as written (Isaiah 33): ״וְצִי אַדִּיר״; its Targum: ״וּבוּרְנִי רַבְתָא״ (Yoma 77)."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:12:40.386773582Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}